                <head>488. Airgram A–5 From the Embassy in Nicaragua to the Department of
                        State<anchor n="1" xml:id="d488-f1"/>
                    <anchor n="2" xml:id="d488-f2"/>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Managua</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1970-01-18">January 18, 1970</date>
                    </dateline></opener>
                <pb facs="d488-01" n="1" xml:id="pgd488-01"/>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT:</label>
                    <item>Country Analysis and Strategy Paper for Nicaragua</item>
                </list>
                <list type="references">
                    <head>REF:</head>
                    <item>CA–6146, CA–6590</item>
                </list>
                <p>As requested in CA–6146 the Country Team has prepared, and herewith submits, the
                    FY 1972 CASP.</p>
